From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ombra engine maintainers <engine@ombra.local>
Date: Sat, 1 Jan 2000 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] eval.probePython, plain-string arguments for eval
 tool.<name>(), wait.maxHeadlessMs

What: eval.probePython, plain-string arguments for eval tool.<name>(), wait.maxHeadlessMs
Why: Benchmark runs wasted turns on Python eval cells that could not start, on tool.edit/tool.read calls rejected for a string argument, and on headless wait calls blocking up to 30 minutes.
Upstream-Status: Ombra-specific; not submitted

